# Build artefacts, rebuilt inside the image. **/ matters: a bare obj/ matches only at the
# context root, so a local Varde.Api/obj would overwrite the restore layer (NETSDK1064)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/logs/

# Version control and editors
.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.idea/

# Docs and recipes
*.md
Dockerfile*
compose*.yml

# Secrets never go into an image
*.env
.env
.env.*
appsettings.Development.json
